{
  "type": "page",
  "id": "air-home",
  "_note": "首页 = 「我的城市」的空气列表(每天看的内容),每行点进城市详情;加组件入口只是页脚一个按钮。\n一个城市都没有时是引导屏(常用城市一键加 + 搜索入口),不硬塞默认城市。",
  "root": {
    "type": "container",
    "id": "root",
    "layout": "list",
    "direction": "vertical",
    "gap": "10pt",
    "padding": "16pt",
    "paddingTop": "${@contentInset.top}pt",
    "paddingBottom": "24pt",
    "depends": [
      {
        "flow": "@[file://page/flow/home.df]",
        "params": {}
      }
    ],
    "items": [
      {
        "op": "if",
        "props": {
          "cond": "$[if::(ge::(${n},1),1,0)]"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "head",
            "h": "34pt",
            "_note": "页头的时效锚跟着「第一个城市那条数据」走:depends 与 row1 **同一条 aq.df、同 params**(同标准 → 同一个缓存键),\n所以首开 / 切标准(新标准还没缓存)/ 下拉之后,数据一回来锚就有时间,且就是这份数据取回的时刻。\nv3 是在 home.df 里进页时读一次缓存时间戳 —— 首开与切标准恰好都没缓存、行取数回来页头不重读,真机上锚几乎永远不出现。\n⚠️ 代价:两处都没缓存时(首开 / 首次切到某标准)第一个城市会并发取两次;有缓存时两处都秒读缓存,不打网络。",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-head.rcn]",
              "depends": [
                {
                  "flow": "@[file://xWidget/flow/aq.df]",
                  "params": {
                    "lat": "${r1lat}",
                    "lon": "${r1lon}",
                    "city": "${r1n}",
                    "_cache": 1,
                    "_reval": "${state.reval}"
                  }
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "seg",
            "h": "40pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-seg.rcn]"
            }
          },
          {
            "op": "if",
            "props": {
              "cond": "$[if::(ge::(${n},1),1,0)]"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "type": "Canvas",
                "id": "row1",
                "h": "106pt",
                "canvas": {
                  "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-row.rcn]",
                  "depends": [
                    {
                      "flow": "@[file://xWidget/flow/aq.df]",
                      "params": {
                        "lat": "${r1lat}",
                        "lon": "${r1lon}",
                        "city": "${r1n}",
                        "_cache": 1,
                        "_reval": "${state.reval}"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "events": {
                  "onClick": "/detail?lat=${r1lat}&lon=${r1lon}&city=${r1q}"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "if",
            "props": {
              "cond": "$[if::(ge::(${n},2),1,0)]"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "type": "Canvas",
                "id": "row2",
                "h": "106pt",
                "canvas": {
                  "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-row.rcn]",
                  "depends": [
                    {
                      "flow": "@[file://xWidget/flow/aq.df]",
                      "params": {
                        "lat": "${r2lat}",
                        "lon": "${r2lon}",
                        "city": "${r2n}",
                        "_cache": 1,
                        "_reval": "${state.reval}"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "events": {
                  "onClick": "/detail?lat=${r2lat}&lon=${r2lon}&city=${r2q}"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "if",
            "props": {
              "cond": "$[if::(ge::(${n},3),1,0)]"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "type": "Canvas",
                "id": "row3",
                "h": "106pt",
                "canvas": {
                  "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-row.rcn]",
                  "depends": [
                    {
                      "flow": "@[file://xWidget/flow/aq.df]",
                      "params": {
                        "lat": "${r3lat}",
                        "lon": "${r3lon}",
                        "city": "${r3n}",
                        "_cache": 1,
                        "_reval": "${state.reval}"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "events": {
                  "onClick": "/detail?lat=${r3lat}&lon=${r3lon}&city=${r3q}"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "if",
            "props": {
              "cond": "$[if::(ge::(${n},4),1,0)]"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "type": "Canvas",
                "id": "row4",
                "h": "106pt",
                "canvas": {
                  "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-row.rcn]",
                  "depends": [
                    {
                      "flow": "@[file://xWidget/flow/aq.df]",
                      "params": {
                        "lat": "${r4lat}",
                        "lon": "${r4lon}",
                        "city": "${r4n}",
                        "_cache": 1,
                        "_reval": "${state.reval}"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "events": {
                  "onClick": "/detail?lat=${r4lat}&lon=${r4lon}&city=${r4q}"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "if",
            "props": {
              "cond": "$[if::(ge::(${n},5),1,0)]"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "type": "Canvas",
                "id": "row5",
                "h": "106pt",
                "canvas": {
                  "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-row.rcn]",
                  "depends": [
                    {
                      "flow": "@[file://xWidget/flow/aq.df]",
                      "params": {
                        "lat": "${r5lat}",
                        "lon": "${r5lon}",
                        "city": "${r5n}",
                        "_cache": 1,
                        "_reval": "${state.reval}"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "events": {
                  "onClick": "/detail?lat=${r5lat}&lon=${r5lon}&city=${r5q}"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "if",
            "props": {
              "cond": "$[if::(ge::(${n},6),1,0)]"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "type": "Canvas",
                "id": "row6",
                "h": "106pt",
                "canvas": {
                  "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-row.rcn]",
                  "depends": [
                    {
                      "flow": "@[file://xWidget/flow/aq.df]",
                      "params": {
                        "lat": "${r6lat}",
                        "lon": "${r6lon}",
                        "city": "${r6n}",
                        "_cache": 1,
                        "_reval": "${state.reval}"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "events": {
                  "onClick": "/detail?lat=${r6lat}&lon=${r6lon}&city=${r6q}"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "if",
            "props": {
              "cond": "$[if::(ge::(${n},7),1,0)]"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "type": "Canvas",
                "id": "row7",
                "h": "106pt",
                "canvas": {
                  "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-row.rcn]",
                  "depends": [
                    {
                      "flow": "@[file://xWidget/flow/aq.df]",
                      "params": {
                        "lat": "${r7lat}",
                        "lon": "${r7lon}",
                        "city": "${r7n}",
                        "_cache": 1,
                        "_reval": "${state.reval}"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "events": {
                  "onClick": "/detail?lat=${r7lat}&lon=${r7lon}&city=${r7q}"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "if",
            "props": {
              "cond": "$[if::(ge::(${n},8),1,0)]"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "type": "Canvas",
                "id": "row8",
                "h": "106pt",
                "canvas": {
                  "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-row.rcn]",
                  "depends": [
                    {
                      "flow": "@[file://xWidget/flow/aq.df]",
                      "params": {
                        "lat": "${r8lat}",
                        "lon": "${r8lon}",
                        "city": "${r8n}",
                        "_cache": 1,
                        "_reval": "${state.reval}"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                "events": {
                  "onClick": "/detail?lat=${r8lat}&lon=${r8lon}&city=${r8q}"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "manage",
            "h": "52pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-manage.rcn]"
            },
            "events": {
              "onClick": "@[file://page/flow/open-city.af]"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "addbtn",
            "h": "56pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-addbtn.rcn]"
            },
            "events": {
              "onClick": {
                "flow": "@[file://page/flow/pick.af]",
                "params": {}
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "foot",
            "h": "130pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-foot-home.rcn]"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "op": "if",
        "props": {
          "cond": "$[if::(ge::(${n},1),0,1)]"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "suHero",
            "h": "96pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-setup-hero.rcn]"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "suHot",
            "h": "108pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-setup-hot.rcn]"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "suSearch",
            "h": "52pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-setup-search.rcn]"
            },
            "events": {
              "onClick": "@[file://page/flow/open-city.af]"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Canvas",
            "id": "suFoot",
            "h": "56pt",
            "canvas": {
              "source": "@[file://page/rc/p-setup-foot.rcn]"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "events": {
      "onLoad": [
        {
          "flow": "@[file://page/flow/revalidate-home.af]",
          "params": {}
        }
      ],
      "onRefresh": "@[file://page/flow/refresh-home.af]"
    }
  }
}
